ot/issues/comments/2670372059/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2670376786","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102979#issuecomment-2670376786","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102979","id":2670376786,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fKrdS","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-20T03:29:33Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T03:29:33Z","body":"Thanks for reporting and checking. I am also not able to reproduce the crash with the attached file. I am on Windows 10 with a Nvidia GPU, so I am not testing on your exact hardware.\n\nMy intuition points to the Intel GPUs as being a possible cause (integrated graphics are not known for having exceptional drivers, and Godot uses Vulkan which tends to be less tested on windows). Maybe it's a graphics related crash and if so it could be random or depend on many other factors. I would still keep your eye open for crashes.\n\nIf you are able to reproduce a crash in the future, having a stacktrace would help. Unfortunately I've never gotten debug symbols to work on Godot official builds, and so my only suggestion for getting a stacktrace is to compile from source which is a big ask, but maybe windows maintainers know better how to get a stacktrace.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2670376786/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]